  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day16
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 16
  storyText: "The air feels different today. Thicker. Heavier. We don't know if it's
    in our heads or real. Some people on social media are saying the zombies are
    toxic now. That the air near them is bad. That you shouldn't get close. Not just
    because they'll bite you \u2014 but because breathing near them might be enough.
    We don't know if it's true. But we closed the window anyway. Taped the gaps with
    whatever we could find. Duct tape. Old clothes. A poster from the wall. The room
    smells like sweat and fear now. Better than the alternative. Outside, the ducks
    are still fine. Of course they are.\r"
